(5709167, 830491, 16488, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this would carry the theme on its own. The orange tint helps but I also think it is much aided by the declaration of the theme and its inclusion in the series of images to be voted on.<br/> <br/>Despite that, it has some compelling elements and even a "creepy" factor.</td>', 'I don''t think this would carry the theme on its own. The orange tint helps but I also think it is much aided by the declaration of the theme and its inclusion in the series of images to be voted on. Despite that, it has some compelling elements and even a "creepy" factor.', '2009-11-01 16:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
