(5710706, 830776, 33400, '<td valign="top">This has a very uncomfortable, true to life, creep factor. Using a child''s hand (evidenced by the horsey pajama sleeve) adds to the discomfort. This is the nightmare my mother scared us with all through my childhood.<br/>That said, since this is a Halloween shot, I can cope.  Looking back and reflecting, I am raising my initial score.  <br/>Assuming that''s not real blood, I''d like to know what you used - it sure looks real.  I would have chosen a better looking apple if possible, and maybe a red one, to go with the blood.<br/>Still all in all, well done.</td>', 'This has a very uncomfortable, true to life, creep factor. Using a child''s hand (evidenced by the horsey pajama sleeve) adds to the discomfort. This is the nightmare my mother scared us with all through my childhood.That said, since this is a Halloween shot, I can cope.  Looking back and reflecting, I am raising my initial score.  Assuming that''s not real blood, I''d like to know what you used - it sure looks real.  I would have chosen a better looking apple if possible, and maybe a red one, to go with the blood.Still all in all, well done.', '2009-11-02 13:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
