(5711414, 830695, 98977, '<td valign="top">the more that i stare at this, the more freaked out i get by the detail in the bandana! There are places where the light actually seems to be shifting to my eyes soooo cool!  I want to learn this.  Thanks for the inspiration!</td>', 'the more that i stare at this, the more freaked out i get by the detail in the bandana! There are places where the light actually seems to be shifting to my eyes soooo cool!  I want to learn this.  Thanks for the inspiration!', '2009-11-02 22:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
