(5711419, 830540, 98977, '<td valign="top">Obviously a great capture to begin with.  Really dig the gritty contrast of your b/w. Nice work on the motion as well.  For my eye, the hair coming off her head upper mid left of frame is a little too pronounced with everything else so smoke or vapor like.  Just my thought.  Thanks for sharing!</td>', 'Obviously a great capture to begin with.  Really dig the gritty contrast of your b/w. Nice work on the motion as well.  For my eye, the hair coming off her head upper mid left of frame is a little too pronounced with everything else so smoke or vapor like.  Just my thought.  Thanks for sharing!', '2009-11-02 22:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5711420, 830660, 98977, '<td valign="top">I really love the texture of this photo.  You can almost feel it .  Great capture and edit! Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'I really love the texture of this photo.  You can almost feel it .  Great capture and edit! Thanks for sharing.', '2009-11-02 22:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
