(5712509, 830786, 111403, '<td valign="top">I like the high definition in the skin, adds to the spooky effect. The "ooze" does not stand out very much, Maybe instead of full black and white you might try reduced saturation and allow the color of the ooze stand out to be more noticeable. Very good composition. 7</td>', 'I like the high definition in the skin, adds to the spooky effect. The "ooze" does not stand out very much, Maybe instead of full black and white you might try reduced saturation and allow the color of the ooze stand out to be more noticeable. Very good composition. 7', '2009-11-03 20:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
