(5714726, 830786, 33400, '<td valign="top">The positioning and reflection are excellent.  It didn''t hit me right away that the reflection eye is staring right at me.  Increased creepy factor for being so understated.  Really well done.</td>', 'The positioning and reflection are excellent.  It didn''t hit me right away that the reflection eye is staring right at me.  Increased creepy factor for being so understated.  Really well done.', '2009-11-04 22:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
