(5714730, 830728, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well done.  Although I might have imagined this being the "Ansel Adams-Family" given the pose...<br/> <br/>Of course if you are very young, or not American, you''re wondering what I''m talking about.</td>', 'Very creative and well done.  Although I might have imagined this being the "Ansel Adams-Family" given the pose... Of course if you are very young, or not American, you''re wondering what I''m talking about.', '2009-11-04 22:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714734, 830521, 33400, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry I couldn''t rate this very high.  Overall the shadow idea might have worked, but I think it would need to be more obvious as what it is supposed to be.  Is the ball a part of the image? the bug-eye perhaps?  Just not clear enough for me.  My greatest concern though is how the floor is out of focus, and yet kind of busy (lines, wood grain, knots).  Maybe next time try a shadow shot on a plain background, so the contrast between light and dark draws your eye first.</td>', 'I''m sorry I couldn''t rate this very high.  Overall the shadow idea might have worked, but I think it would need to be more obvious as what it is supposed to be.  Is the ball a part of the image? the bug-eye perhaps?  Just not clear enough for me.  My greatest concern though is how the floor is out of focus, and yet kind of busy (lines, wood grain, knots).  Maybe next time try a shadow shot on a plain background, so the contrast between light and dark draws your eye first.', '2009-11-04 22:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
