(5715477, 830737, 103142, '<td valign="top">fascinating place. This just seems a tad flat. Perhaps increasing the contrast, if you want the washed out colors, or increasing the saturation a tad to bring out the greens and reds a little more. One other thought is focusing in more on the temple. The trees are given equal weight to the formations. If you would have zoomed in more on the lower left, it could be more interesting.</td>', 'fascinating place. This just seems a tad flat. Perhaps increasing the contrast, if you want the washed out colors, or increasing the saturation a tad to bring out the greens and reds a little more. One other thought is focusing in more on the temple. The trees are given equal weight to the formations. If you would have zoomed in more on the lower left, it could be more interesting.', '2009-11-05 14:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
